{"product_id":"the-secret-to-teen-power","title":"The Secret to Teen Power","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSince its original publication, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003eThe Secret\u003c\/i\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan\u003e has inspired millions to live extraordinary lives. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003eThe Secret to Teen Power\u003c\/i\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan\u003e explores the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cb\u003eLaw of Attraction\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan\u003e from a teenager’s point of view. All the themes of teenage life – self-image, relationships, school, family, ambitions, values, and dreams – are covered in this all-embracing book. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003eThe Secret to Teen Power\u003c\/i\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is crammed with powerful tips and strategies to help young readers discover their purpose, achieve happiness and harmony in every aspect of their lives, and create abundance and joy. In their own language, in words they themselves use, this fantastic new book will empower teenagers all over the world to reach to the stars and to create \u0026amp; live their dreams.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAuthor: Paul Harrington\u003cbr\u003eISBN: 978184738693\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003ePages: 365\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44727157620889,"sku":"3RG9781847386939","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/cvr9781847386939_9781847386939_hr.jpg?v=1723013737","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-secret-to-teen-power","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}